# Default deny: only explicitly approved build inputs.
**

# Python project metadata and reproducible dependencies.
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md

# Application source code.
!src/
!src/**

# Defense in depth: never include secrets or local artifacts.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
